---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Saddle"
  description="Saddle is a macOS menu bar app for external drives: real-time mount status, one-click mount and unmount, drive groups, and launch and wake rules — drives you unmounted stay unmounted."
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[65ch] flex-col items-center py-12 text-center sm:py-20">
    <img
      src="/app-icons/saddle.png"
      alt=""
      width="128"
      height="128"
      class="h-32 w-32 rounded-[22.5%] shadow-md ring-1 ring-slate-900/10"
    />
    <h1 class="mt-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Saddle</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      A macOS menu bar app for external drives. One icon, real-time mount status,
      click to mount or unmount — with drive groups, batch actions, and drives
      that stay unmounted when you said so, even when macOS thinks otherwise.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/smandable/Saddle/releases/latest"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-accent-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-700"
      data-umami-event="saddle-github-download"
    >
      <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M10.75 2.75a.75.75 0 0 0-1.5 0v8.614L6.295 8.235a.75.75 0 1 0-1.09 1.03l4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.09 0l4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 0 0-1.09-1.03l-2.955 3.129V2.75Z" />
        <path d="M3.5 12.75a.75.75 0 0 0-1.5 0v2.5A2.75 2.75 0 0 0 4.75 18h10.5A2.75 2.75 0 0 0 18 15.25v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 0-1.5 0v2.5c0 .69-.56 1.25-1.25 1.25H4.75c-.69 0-1.25-.56-1.25-1.25v-2.5Z" />
      </svg>
      Download the .dmg<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span>
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
      Signed and notarized, for macOS 13.5 (Ventura) or later. Or via Homebrew:
    </p>
    <code class="mt-2 rounded-md bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700"
      >brew tap smandable/tap &amp;&amp; brew install --cask saddle</code
    >
    <nav
      class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500"
      aria-label="Saddle links"
    >
      <a href="/projects#saddle" class="transition-colors hover:text-accent-600">More about the app</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/smandable/Saddle"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="transition-colors hover:text-accent-600"
      >GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/smandable/Saddle/issues"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="transition-colors hover:text-accent-600"
      >Report an issue<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</Layout>
